WEBVTT

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.840
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.440
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:34.010
who travel the world, searching 
for your ingredients.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.320
And the ingredient at the 
top of this world is GOD,

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.320
which is being sought by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.000
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.640
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.310
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.110
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:08.750
With you guys

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.920
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.350
If we join forces

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.360
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.960
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:28.530
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:34.040
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.110
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.110
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:42.110
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:47.350
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.360
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.360
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.170
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:05.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.170
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:16.080
The curtain rose on the Cooking Fest at last!

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:20.020
The preliminary round is 
the Cooking Triathlon!

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:23.320
Competing against chefs who 
possess overwhelming ability,

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:26.690
Komatsu lagged way behind.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:31.200
But then, a new chef awoke!

00:02:35.070 --> 00:02:35.800
Crap!

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:42.170
The fest has already started!

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:48.780
Meet Legendary Chef Brunch the Tengu!

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:53.450
Alright, here I go!

00:03:17.140 --> 00:03:19.740
Chef Komatsu is slow! Slow!

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.150
Way too slow!

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.780
He's slower than slow!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.250
He's drowning after all, isn't he?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.750
Hang in there, Komatsu!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:36.060
Now most of the chefs are reaching 
the halfway point of Takoyaki Island!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:39.860
And with a big lead is...

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.170
...the oil-smeared Wabutora!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.300
I'm not smeared with it.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:55.680
Catching up to him is... Setsuno!

00:03:56.650 --> 00:03:59.120
The National Gourmet Treasure, Setsuno!

00:03:59.120 --> 00:04:02.050
Just like that, she sprints 
her way to the top!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.430
And now we've got the Cooking King, Zaus!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.060
Also catching up is the Mach Cook, Ton!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.100
Okay...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.960
I'll do my best!

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:46.200
I'm gonna swim...

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.530
...under my own power!

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.100
Whoa.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.670
Setsuno makes a cool arrival, 
not even out of breath!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.910
It took her just a minute 
and a half to make it!

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.310
Munage-san! Munage-san!

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.280
Oh, yes, Tina-chin?

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:07.050
The leader of the pack, 
Setsunon, I mean, Setsuno-san,

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.350
is about to choose her ingredients!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.350
Let's see here...

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:11.420
This and this...

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:12.690
I'll take that too.

00:05:12.690 --> 00:05:14.860
The next stage is by bicycle.

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.460
After finishing their swim, the contestants 
take the ingredients they've chosen

00:05:16.090 --> 00:05:18.330
Second Stage

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:20.200
over to one of those food 
delivery-type bikes.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:22.030
They'll put their ingredients in the carrier.

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:26.370
The second stage goes to 
Rock Candy Mountain Pass.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:29.070
After that, they have to run!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.240
The key to winning is how 
you choose the ingredients.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:35.510
If you choose a heaping helping, 
the race will become a real drag.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.250
There! Zaus. Wabutora, and Ton have arrived!

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.920
What a thrilling race!

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.120
The arena is also heating up

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:51.060
from medium to well-done!

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.870
Munage-san! Bad news!

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:05.740
What?!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:08.480
Mr. Hanage?

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:12.450
The troublemaker who's 
always in the top ranking,

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:16.050
but has only participated in the fest once?!

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:18.220
B-But...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.830
...he's also a genius chef

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:29.630
who won a decisive victory that one time!

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.570
If Zebra is the poster boy for 
"bad boy Gourmet Hunters",

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:39.810
then the poster boy for "bad 
boy chefs" is definitely

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:42.010
that man!

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.720
What the...?!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.090
Look at that!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.390
Somebody's standing there!

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.300
It can't be!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:03.300
Everybody, let's look at 
the roof of Hotel Cooking!

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:04.800
Not all the chefs

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:09.840
participating in this fest had shown up yet!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.740
That's the last one!

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.910
He's a living legend!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.120
This fest

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.920
is going to be a wild one.

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:23.960
He's a mysterious man who comes from a 
place that's full of strange ingredients,

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.060
the Hex Food World!

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:28.530
The chef of Tengu Castle,

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.360
which serves bizarre food...

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:34.030
The chef who's ranked at number three!

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:38.300
Brunch the Tengu

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:43.310
is here!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:47.850
It's Brunch!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:54.790
Brunch the Tengu, Bizarre Cooking
3rd place in the World Chef Ranking

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.750
Brunch has come!

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.620
Is it the real thing?!

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.250
He really is a tengu!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:54.750
Scary!

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.620
Still, I'm bummed out.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:02.190
I came all this way, stayed 
in a hotel, got ready...

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:05.560
But then I drank too much 
Kappa Fin Sake last night.

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:09.930
Ah, well. All I gotta do is overtake 
everybody else in a single spurt.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:12.240
So that's Brunch?

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:14.010
This is the first time I've seen him.

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.280
Hey, look at that guy.

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:26.420
He must be hurtin' for money. 
He ain't wearin' any socks.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:30.820
That's our Zonge-sama! Always catching 
details with your sharp eyes!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.630
Tengu always go barefoot with geta.

00:08:35.060 --> 00:08:37.930
What a delicious development!

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:42.330
The tension in the arena 
could boil an egg in a flash!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.800
It's super boiling in here!

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:06.890
Shut the hell up!

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.440
W-What a voice!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:28.180
W-What the...?!

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:31.950
You got a lot of nerve!

00:09:31.950 --> 00:09:34.790
C'mere, you tengu bastard!

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:37.390
Z-Zebra?!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:48.730
You're...

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.970
...Zebra of the Four Kings!

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:58.470
You're Zebra.

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:06.280
You're just as the old 
Daruma man described you.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:10.950
The Gourmet Hunter who won't 
partner up even if it kills him.

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:13.990
What are you talkin' about?

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:16.290
If that's an offer, forget about it, dumbass!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.890
I already got

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:25.730
a partner in mind. Name's Komatsu 
and you can't hold a candle to him!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.270
Komatsu?

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.370
Who the hell is that?

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.740
You say he's better than me?

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:34.040
Although he's not a candidate 
to be your partner, Zebra.

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:36.270
Komatsu is my partner!

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:38.310
He don't suit you!

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:40.110
What's that?!

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:44.250
Hey, Zebra! I ain't just gonna let that go.

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.990
Come on, you guys, not here!

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.020
Do you hear me?!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.790
You're an annoying buzz in my ear!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.520
These guys are a pain in the ass.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.490
Okay, okay, both of you...

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:57.230
Now I'm mad!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:57.800
Okay, okay, Toriko!

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.000
Don't you morons ignore me!

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:04.100
That's enough, you knuckleheads!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.100
Mess with me and I'll kill ya!

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:07.640
What was that?!

00:12:07.640 --> 00:12:11.140
Is that Komatsu guy in the fest?

00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:13.080
Yeah, that's right...

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:15.850
Interesting...

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:18.420
The partner of Toriko of the Four Kings...

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:22.250
Then I think I'll make mincemeat out of him.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.990
Not a chance, Brunch!

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.930
Say again?

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.430
There ain't nobody

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.500
who can beat me.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.600
Better not underestimate Komatsu.

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:53.450
You guys have mastered Honoring the Food?

00:12:57.520 --> 00:12:59.060
Perfect.

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:02.790
Then I'm gonna go check out

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.560
your precious Komatsu!

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:20.010
Even though he's late,

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:22.210
Brunch the Tengu

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.580
has entered the competition!

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:25.820
Go, Brunch!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.250
This is getting even more interesting!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:51.310
That bastard is totally cocky.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:56.050
But one glance and he could tell 
we've mastered Honoring the Food.

00:13:56.050 --> 00:13:57.050
Yeah.

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:58.780
He's strong.

00:13:58.780 --> 00:14:01.420
I sensed that he's bursting 
with electromagnetic waves.

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.920
It's extremely rare to see 
a life force like that.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.790
The Hex Food World is in 
the Gourmet World, right?

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:09.760
That alone guarantees his strength.

00:14:09.760 --> 00:14:12.360
Although I think I could take him in a fight.

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:17.270
But we're not the ones who are 
gonna fight him this time around.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.570
Komatsu is!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.910
Chef Komatsu has finally... at last...

00:14:27.910 --> 00:14:31.150
...barely made it out of the sea! Good luck!

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:40.990
Matsu! Get a move on!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:06.020
W-W-What is that?!

00:15:23.270 --> 00:15:25.000
Brunch has arrived!

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:28.610
He finished his "swim" in 
the twinkling of an eye!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.880
H-Huh?

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:38.850
Um...

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:41.190
A-A-Are you...

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:44.360
Are you... Are you...?

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.860
Brunch-san? You are Brunch-san, aren't you?!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.800
Who are you?

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.970
N-Nice to meet you.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:57.140
Um, I'm Komatsu.

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.140
What'd you just say?

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:06.680
My name is Komatsu.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.680
Komatsu?!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:15.520
Komatsu?!

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:17.460
You're Komatsu?!

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:18.660
Y-Yes...

00:16:21.330 --> 00:16:23.060
What?!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.300
You're Komatsu?! Really?!

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:25.800
Yes.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.900
I imagined someone really nasty!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.930
You're just a kid!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:29.800
Yes!

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:30.870
And you're in last place!

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:33.240
You're really Toriko's partner?!

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.110
Yes, that's right.

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.840
Um, though you probably can't tell...

00:16:36.840 --> 00:16:39.840
Liar! Yank my chain and you get decked!

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:43.250
There's no way you're better 
than me! It's unimaginable!

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:47.290
I'm better than you?

00:16:48.920 --> 00:16:50.760
As if!

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:52.520
Yeah, right?!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:53.660
Right!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:02.070
What the hell's wrong with you?!

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.140
You gotta agree with everything I say?!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.240
Um... Brunch-san...

00:17:06.240 --> 00:17:08.910
A-Actually...

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:11.380
Could I have your autograph

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.340
about five times?

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.380
What the hell?! Why should 
I give you my autograph?!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:17.080
What's with five times?! 
That's going overboard!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:17.620
Really?

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:19.320
This is ridiculous!

00:17:19.320 --> 00:17:21.790
The Four Kings bragged about you so much

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:23.790
that I was lookin' forward to this,

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:26.090
but you can't put up any kind of fight!

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:26.620
I'm really...

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.060
I'm goin' on ahead.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.260
U-U-Um...

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.230
Matsu!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.830
Don't let him make fun of you!

00:17:33.830 --> 00:17:37.040
Komatsu-kun, you don't need his autograph!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:44.980
Jeez, are these all the 
ingredients that are left?

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.010
These ingredients bum me out too.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:48.850
Not me!

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:55.820
A Ramen Spider that spews 
ramen noodles from its mouth.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.590
A fruit that has a slight chestnut 
flavor, Chestnutangerine!

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.430
Eye-poppingly spiciness

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:04.030
that melts in with the savoriness of 
the thick meat, Chili Pepper Pork.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.860
Granted, there aren't any 
high-class ingredients left,

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:12.070
but these are still all great ingredients 
that can be used to cook tasty dishes!

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:14.110
I wish I could take them all with me!

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:23.850
What the...?! Suddenly, the 
ingredients are glowing!

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.580
I see!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.250
You want to go too, huh?

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.690
I see! You too, huh?

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.760
But all of you together are 
too heavy for me to carry.

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.360
You too?

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:37.860
This kid can hear

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.300
the voices of the ingredients!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.100
They're happy!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:47.270
The ingredients were bummed out because 
the other contestants didn't pick 'em,

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.240
but now they're all excited!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.250
Komatsu...

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:01.050
So this is Komatsu...

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.590
Interesting.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:06.820
What a waste.

00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.960
With all this left,

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:10.800
and I have to leave it here...

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:14.100
I know what you mean. It is a waste.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:21.040
So why don't we take everything 
and cook it all up?

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:22.770
Without leaving one thing behind.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.210
B-Brunch-san!

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:38.660
I-It seems Brunch and Chef Komatsu

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:42.190
are going to use the remainder 
of the ingredients!

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.300
Alright, alright!

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:49.500
The ingredients say they wanna go, 
so we'll take 'em all with us!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:52.370
Brunch-san, thank you!

00:19:57.240 --> 00:20:01.410
You ready? We're gonna overtake everybody 
else in a single spurt. Komatsu!

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:02.680
Ready,

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.650
Brunch-san!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:24.470
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:31.710
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:37.280
Only a smile has no flavor, 
so wipe your tears

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:43.820
After a downpour of rain from the 
sky, the sun always rises high

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:49.530
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:20:49.530 --> 00:20:55.170
My heart races and I become captivated

00:20:55.170 --> 00:21:04.040
Don’t give up! I’m closest to 
you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:08.880
Always believe in yourself!

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:21.490
Guess the Legend! The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.490
Guess the Legend! The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:26.160
I'm your host, Tina, and 
welcome to a new segment!

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:29.600
This is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.470
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

